 igning to finishing. Open to all levels\, participants will dive into weav
 ing a sampler\, or a simple project like a scarf or table runner.Experienc
 ed weavers will explore two-shuttle weaving by setting up a loom for a sam
 pler in either Monks Belt\, Overshot\, Crackle\, or Summer & Winter. Weave
 rs using the “round robin” technique will get a chance to sample the f
 our different patterns. Time allowing\, a small project may be accomplishe
 d —materials not included.Four & eight shaft looms available courtesy of
